wer the score the better. You can also see how you hold up against those on your steam friends list.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1502530/extras/07c487c96c9fc537f1d8e3bfee587736.avif?t=1612176729\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Skins:</u></strong><br>With 10 skins to unlock and more coming, there is a skin for any style. Pick up gems and complete levels to earn gold to spend in the store.<br><br><strong><u>Trails:</u></strong><br>Trails refers to the dust particles that follow the player when jumping and changing direction. Earn gold to unlock more styles of trail along with bigger and longer trails. Be sure to try and match your trail and skin, we wouldn't want you looking unfashionable.",
